  "refined_query": "Research question: Are there more color pigments to discover?\nContext: It is possible to create new pigments, but not new colors. The first synthetic pigment was made in the early 1700s. In 2009, chemist Mas Subramanian accidently created a new blue pigment called “YInMn Blue.”"
